               <text>
                  <table width="65%">
                     <col width="100%" align="left" valign="top"/>
                     <tbody>
                        <tr styleCode="Toprule Botrule">
                           <td styleCode="Lrule Rrule">
                              <content styleCode="bold">WARNING:</content> Accidental overdose of iron-containing products is a leading cause of fatal poisoning in children under 6. Keep this product out of reach of children. In case of accidental overdose, call a doctor or poison control center immediately. 									</td>
